# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day19

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| occur | 발생하다 | The earthquake occurred during the night. |
| retain | 유지하다, 보유하다 | The material can retain heat. |
| determine | 결정하다, 알아내다 | Researchers determined the cause of the problem. |

---

## Synonyms

### occur
→ happen / take place

### retain
→ keep / preserve

### determine
→ identify / establish

---

## Useful Collocations

occur frequently
→ 자주 발생하다

retain information
→ 정보를 기억하다

determine the cause
→ 원인을 알아내다

